# Scoring & report

## Stack

- Live path: `computeReportMetrics` → V4 (`metricsV4` ≈ V3 numbers).
- T (V3/V4): `0.55×stability + 0.45×late`; IQR on on-time RTs per slice (N≥4, 1.5×IQR).
- A/I/H from `metrics.js` behaviors; FA not in H; late not in A.

## RT overall vs phases

- Per-slice IQR ⇒ overall included N may ≠ sum of phase included N.
- Audit **rule B** (`algorithmAudit.js`): IQR-only flips → PASS; unexpected/orphan → FAIL; no ledger → NOT_VERIFIED.
- Do not redefine RT_FILTER to require equal counts.

## PDF

- Layout: `pdfReport.js`. Copy: `reportPdfStrings.js` / `reportPdfIt.js`.
- T user-facing definition: consistency + on-time only (no V4 formula aside in clinical definition).
- Stored email PDFs need refresh after copy/score changes (`refreshStoredReports` / admin panel / `npm run refresh-reports`).

## Independent checks

- Score calc / A/I/H independent audits are **separate** from `rt_filter` group — do not merge them back into RT_FILTER PASS conditions.
